{"id":"vod_sn_38720","vodId":"38720","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"濑户的花嫁","name_cn":"濑户的花嫁","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/f07df1e6f44fbcaad8ed9e8a69e9a95b.jpg"},"summary":"在人鱼的世界中有着这样的规定，如果不巧被某人类看到了真身，那么，除了和其结婚或将其杀死，没有第三种选择。普通的少年满潮永澄（水岛大宙 配音）在一次溺水中被人鱼濑户灿（桃井春子 配音）所救，按照规定，灿成为了永澄的妻子。没想到，灿居然是濑户海黑社会老大的女儿，个性有些懦弱的永澄将面对怎样悲惨的命运呢？　　同时，随着永澄和灿的婚期的推进，越来越多的人鱼聚集到了永澄的身边。双重人格的江户前留奈（野川樱 配音），一心想要至永澄于死地的卷（桑谷夏子 配音），精明强干的剑士不知火明乃（喜多村英梨 配音），这些可爱的人鱼们除了给永澄的生活增添了不少麻烦外，也带来了很多的快乐。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:04:03","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/gXKp23TE0E1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/CZu4cQ3SxF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/muzLLFEKdN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/8rLDLbh9fz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/QDNjBaruSR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/DGsdYcDsMh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qxbw6mrQnx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/2wLNtLPh7w1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zcJDSVLzxQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/rsEHWTvtM21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/huGxWb9EqQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/pZkm33Cpir1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ZzFqJCZg8S1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/eBKTdkuYJh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","